        | Log | <b>Hello</b>, world! | DEBUG    | html=true | # DEBUG as HTML. |
        | Log | Hello, console!   | console=yes | | # Log also to the console. |
        | Log | Hello, console!   | CONSOLE     | | # Log also to the console. |
        | Log | Null is \x00    | formatter=repr | | # Log ``'Null is \x00'``. |

