    | ***** Settings *****
    | Library         OperatingSystem
    |
    | ***** Variables *****
    | ${PATH}         ${CURDIR}/example.txt
    |
    | ***** Test Cases *****
    | Example
    |     `Create File`          ${PATH}    Some text
    |     `File Should Exist`    ${PATH}
    |     `Copy File`            ${PATH}    ~/file.txt
