    | `Should Be Equal` | ${b.tail}     | ${SPACE}and${SPACE} |

    == attrib ==

    A Python dictionary containing attributes of the element.

    | ${2nd} =          | `Get Element`       | ${XML} | second |
    | `Should Be Equal` | ${2nd.attrib['id']} | 2      |        |
